# N4 (LMX_semantics.ru.md #fields, #method-parts: call: code code takes the admission every pair takes; the data
# scanner sees the root heads only): as data, S has the root heads x and if; the int: y 2 of its if body is no place
# of S. y is missing: the implicit call throw before S runs, taken by catch: call, so seen keeps 0. Entry 7.
int: seen 0
S:
    int: x 0
    node\seen: 1
    if: x = 0
        int: y 2
end: S
fn: run () int
    int: r 82
    call: S S
    catch: call ()
        r: 83
        if: node\seen = 0
            r: 7
    ---
return: r
int: got run()
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: got; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
